 r←Test_ProcessTool_012(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;n;⎕TRAP;buffer;data
⍝ Exercise "ProcessTool". Suppress "Sort by column" and checks whether it is honoured.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.posn←30 40
 parms.style←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.checkboxes←1
 parms.sortByCol←0
 data←parms.data←⍕¨1000+⍳20
 parms.colTitles←'No' 'Filename'
 buffer←(⍕¨1000+⍳20),[0.5]⌽10⍴¨,¨20⍴⎕A

 n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.ProcessTool.Create buffer'∆DealWithData'
 ⎕DL 0.3
 ⎕NQ n.List'ColumnClick' 1 1 0
 →T.PassesIf buffer≡¯1↓[1]n.List.(Items,ReportInfo)
 →T.PassesIf n.∆parms.data≡data

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
